                        "form": "mogged"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2663be33-5d04-3fa1-9a85-631c7519be96",
                        "entry_id": "1902eb08-9fc9-37b5-bc20-32347c4a3960",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To be significantly more attractive than (someone or something); to dominate in appearance."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Internet",
                            "intransitive",
                            "stative",
                            "transitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "747b6891-ab3a-42c0-9ec0-5f5d78c4c465",
                                "sense_id": "2663be33-5d04-3fa1-9a85-631c7519be96",
                                "text": "His face mogs mine to hell and back."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "15d32ae4-3be0-4d4b-bb72-8d161a713126",
                                "sense_id": "2663be33-5d04-3fa1-9a85-631c7519be96",
                                "text": "This youngshit mogs me: I'm such a hon."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "84ed783a-9cf2-4b78-a4ae-92d4cd91cea6",
                                "sense_id": "2663be33-5d04-3fa1-9a85-631c7519be96",
                                "text": "Seriously, whenever I'm on campus, I just get mogged to fucking oblivion. The men are all so fucking god-like compared to a subhuman loser like me."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fc07ed9d-7271-4922-b0f1-7673285f31c5",
                                "sense_id": "2663be33-5d04-3fa1-9a85-631c7519be96",
                                "text": "Elliot Rodger mogs pretty much everyone."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "735dc4fb-38a8-4f4c-99be-ff22af17d1ae",
                                "sense_id": "2663be33-5d04-3fa1-9a85-631c7519be96",
                                "text": "\"Watching a Gigachad mog [i.e., outperform] a Chad will be the most pleasurable moment of my life,\" wrote an incels.co user last year, as \"in that moment a Chad will truly understand the pain incels go through.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0362b596-2007-4070-a3cd-06b05b725044",
                                "sense_id": "2663be33-5d04-3fa1-9a85-631c7519be96",
                                "text": "Jordan Peterson totally blew his big moment of cultural relevancy and celebrity by getting mogged by [Slavoj] Zizek, becoming a pillhead and eating too much meat. Not very cash money of him."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "32acf93e-ed31-47ad-a114-ab89623c0d21",
                                "sense_id": "2663be33-5d04-3fa1-9a85-631c7519be96",
                                "text": "It's so funny when people misgender me because I mog like 75% of cis women"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "96e7864e-55ed-42c7-b89d-422bc2c4a87a",
                                "sense_id": "2663be33-5d04-3fa1-9a85-631c7519be96",
                                "text": "she's not even upset about them mogging her, she's upset them looking the same as her. She considers being our equal to be a horror of horrors."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "cb7955fa-94f0-35fb-91fe-0fd17028eca1",
                        "entry_id": "1902eb08-9fc9-37b5-bc20-32347c4a3960",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To be superior to (something); to beat, outclass."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Internet",
                            "broadly",
                            "stative",
                            "transitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b288cca7-9c41-48f0-ae37-d9fcb26a97ed",
                                "sense_id": "cb7955fa-94f0-35fb-91fe-0fd17028eca1",
                                "text": "You live on an alternate world I take it? Joker mogs any MCU film. Batman will too."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "63ba0ecf-b4c3-4f69-902f-d67a21bd73af",
                                "sense_id": "cb7955fa-94f0-35fb-91fe-0fd17028eca1",
                                "text": "Hyderabad is enough to mog any Pakistani city in infrastructure."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "85711079-7417-4869-955f-991179c360fb",
                                "sense_id": "cb7955fa-94f0-35fb-91fe-0fd17028eca1",
                                "text": "Internet absolutely mogs real life because here you can meet so many smart and intelligent people. I met a few here who I'm genuinely sure are in the top 10 of the smartest humans alive right now."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
